SPRINT 2 — DREAM LIFECYCLE HARDENING
====================================
STATUS: IN PROGRESS

Goal
----
Turn the Sprint 1 prototype into a reliable Dream lifecycle with:

- one shared entry/exit system
- persistent sessions
- safe Dream entry
- correct vanilla sleep validation
- normal vanilla sleep available when Dream activation is disabled


Current Dream Flow
------------------

DREAM ACTIVATION DISABLED

Player uses bed
↓
Dream mod does nothing
↓
100% vanilla sleeping behavior


DREAM ACTIVATION ENABLED

Player uses bed
↓
Vanilla evaluates whether sleeping is allowed
↓
If vanilla rejects sleep:
    Dream does not start

If vanilla accepts sleep:
    Player briefly enters valid vanilla sleep
    ↓
    Normal vanilla sleep behavior/stat/advancement occurs
    ↓
    Dream mod stops normal sleep
    ↓
    DreamService.enterDream(...)
    ↓
    Player enters dream:dream


