Same-Night Dream Re-entry
-------------------------

Future rule:

After waking from a Dream, prevent that player from entering another
Dream during the same Minecraft night.

This matters primarily in multiplayer when another player causes the
night to continue rather than immediately advancing to morning.

Exact "same night" semantics should be designed alongside future
night-progression behavior.


